WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.078 --> 00:00:13.251
Once upon another time, there was a girl named Beauty.

2
00:00:13.252 --> 00:00:17.756
She lived above her father's shop.

3
00:00:17.757 --> 00:00:24.399
He sold fine cloth from faraway lands.

4
00:00:24.400 --> 00:00:34.311
Beauty helped Father in the shop.

5
00:00:34.312 --> 00:00:39.818
One day the shelves were bare.

6
00:00:39.819 --> 00:00:44.802
"Father!" Beauty said. "Where's our cloth?"

7
00:00:44.803 --> 00:00:54.777
He sighed. "The ship carrying it is lost at sea."

8
00:00:54.778 --> 00:00:59.155
Later Beauty was working alone.

9
00:00:59.156 --> 00:01:06.001
The sheriff came in. "Where's your father?"

10
00:01:06.002 --> 00:01:08.875
"He's at the dock," Beauty said.

11
00:01:08.876 --> 00:01:11.069
"May I help you?"

12
00:01:11.070 --> 00:01:13.211
The sheriff scowled.

13
00:01:13.212 --> 00:01:15.813
"He owes money to everyone in town.

14
00:01:15.814 --> 00:01:19.636
If he doesn't pay, I'll put him in jail!"

15
00:01:19.637 --> 00:01:22.998
"Please, sir," Beauty said.

16
00:01:22.999 --> 00:01:26.467
"He'll pay everyone when the ship arrives."

17
00:01:26.468 --> 00:01:30.933
The sheriff crossed his arms.

18
00:01:30.934 --> 00:01:36.560
"He has two months—or jail!"

19
00:01:36.561 --> 00:01:41.082
When Father returned, Beauty rushed toward him.

20
00:01:41.083 --> 00:01:43.280
"Did the ship arrive?"

21
00:01:43.281 --> 00:01:52.723
Father shook his head. "Maybe tomorrow."

22
00:01:52.724 --> 00:01:59.268
Weeks passed.

23
00:01:59.269 --> 00:02:04.458
The ship still didn't arrive.

24
00:02:04.459 --> 00:02:13.476
Father grew more worried.

25
00:02:13.477 --> 00:02:22.752
"Beauty, you deserve a better life," he said.

26
00:02:22.753 --> 00:02:25.630
"Go stay with your sister.

27
00:02:25.631 --> 00:02:28.922
She married a rich man."

28
00:02:28.923 --> 00:02:32.606
Beauty loved Father deeply.

29
00:02:32.607 --> 00:02:39.082
"I'm staying here," she said.

30
00:02:39.083 --> 00:02:45.107
Then one day a letter came.

31
00:02:45.108 --> 00:02:53.249
"Oh no!" Father cried.

32
00:02:53.250 --> 00:03:00.321
"The ship sank. We lost everything."

33
00:03:00.322 --> 00:03:07.813
"That's awful!" Beauty said.

34
00:03:07.814 --> 00:03:12.646
Father made a plan.

35
00:03:12.647 --> 00:03:16.236
"I'll go to my cottage in the forest.

36
00:03:16.237 --> 00:03:19.727
The sheriff won't find me there."

37
00:03:19.728 --> 00:03:25.191
He looked at Beauty. "The forest is cursed.

38
00:03:25.192 --> 00:03:30.105
The woodcutters say a monster lives there now.

39
00:03:30.106 --> 00:03:33.324
You'll stay with your sister."

40
00:03:33.325 --> 00:03:40.379
"A monster?" Beauty laughed. "Nonsense!

41
00:03:40.380 --> 00:03:45.833
I'm coming with you, Father."

42
00:03:45.834 --> 00:03:53.222
He sighed. "Fine."

43
00:03:53.223 --> 00:04:00.943
That night Beauty and Father went to the cottage.

44
00:04:00.944 --> 00:04:08.808
It was small and dark.

45
00:04:08.809 --> 00:04:14.759
But Beauty looked around and smiled.

46
00:04:14.760 --> 00:04:19.510
"Looks aren't everything.

47
00:04:19.511 --> 00:04:28.914
I like it here."

